{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Spotted Headscarf is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be ",["l","裁缝","tailored"]," using ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," and a ",["l","红蘑菇","Red Mushroom"]," at the sewing machine inside ",["l","柳巷2号","Emily's house"]," or the ",["l","缝纫机","Sewing Machine"]," received as a reward for the ",["l","任务","\"Rock Rejuvenation\""]," special order. It can also be obtained from ",["l","沙漠节","Emily's outfit services"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". Female players have a ≈2% chance to receive the outfit with the Spotted Headscarf."]],["p",["There is a small chance to receive this hat from slaying ",["l","怪物","monsters"],", breaking ",["l","矿井","crates and barrels"],", chopping ",["l","树","trees"],", shaking trees with seeds, digging ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s, or ",["l","淘盘","panning"],"."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The Spotted Headscarf outfit also includes the ",["f","Shirt202.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Classy Top (F)"]," and ",["f","Long_Dress.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Long Dress"]," (dyed RGB value 142,1,1)."]]]]]]]}